[ Laughter ]
Right.

00:19:53.992 --> 00:19:56.195
And you think I wrote that?
-I do.

00:19:56.195 --> 00:19:58.363
I think that you sort
of pointed towards yourself

00:19:58.363 --> 00:20:00.332
by making the fake account
notandysamberg.

00:20:00.332 --> 00:20:03.135
-The handle says it´s not me.

00:20:03.135 --> 00:20:04.503
-Alright.
-By the way,

00:20:04.503 --> 00:20:05.871
notandysamberg was taken.

00:20:05.871 --> 00:20:07.506
I had to get 1.

00:20:07.506 --> 00:20:10.309
[ Laughter ]

00:20:10.309 --> 00:20:14.112
There´s still out there
not -- not me.

00:20:14.112 --> 00:20:16.014
-Beat you to the punch.
-Snatched it up.

00:20:16.014 --> 00:20:17.749
-A lot of people not you,
don´t feel bad.

00:20:17.749 --> 00:20:19.251
Finishing second´s great.

00:20:19.251 --> 00:20:20.752
Alright, so I do --
I want to take a minute.

00:20:20.752 --> 00:20:22.087
Obviously, I know
where you land on this.

00:20:22.087 --> 00:20:24.356
I would like to ask the entire
"Brooklyn Nine-Nine"

00:20:24.356 --> 00:20:26.225
cast,
will go down from beginning,

00:20:26.225 --> 00:20:29.561
Is Frisbee a good dog
or bad dog.

00:20:29.561 --> 00:20:31.129
Starting with you.

00:20:31.129 --> 00:20:33.398
-Oh, Frisbee´s a good dog.

00:20:33.398 --> 00:20:35.734
-Very good dog.
-Good dog.

00:20:35.734 --> 00:20:37.636
-Good dog.
-Great dog.

00:20:37.636 --> 00:20:38.770
Andy´s always wrong.

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:39.972
-Great dog.

00:20:39.972 --> 00:20:41.607
-Ehh.
[ Laughter ]

00:20:41.607 --> 00:20:43.575
-And, Andy, final thoughts.

00:20:43.575 --> 00:20:45.277
-Steaming hot pile of [bleep]

00:20:45.277 --> 00:20:47.479
[ Laughter ]

00:20:47.479 --> 00:20:49.147
